===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|vertu}}, {{m|enm|virtue}}, borrowed from {{der|en|xno|vertu}}, {{m|fro|virtu}}, from {{der|en|la|virtus|t=manliness, bravery, worth, moral excellence}}, from {{m|la|vir||man}}. {{doublet|en|vertu}}. See {{m|en|virile}}. In this sense, displaced {{ncog|ang|cræft}}, whence {{w|Modern English}} {{m|en|craft}}.

